# Platform: mobilesite
# Requirement: GJDT-22788 — Conversational RFQ / B2B Assist
# Case NC11: Logged-out user sees login gate (no RFQ) | P3 | Negative / Auth | Mumbai / Roofing Sheets — fresh browser, NOT logged in
# Expected: Chat shows "Log in to begin!" and Log In button opens login
# Last staging result in the sheet: OBS (05-Oct) – Log In button does nothing when chatbot URL is opened standalone
# Tags: b2b, rfq, b2b-assist, GJDT-22788, normal, P3
store "Mumbai" as city
store "Roofing Sheets" as category
store "(set by the chat step group)" as bot_reply
call SG_22788_Search_Product_In_City
# The 'Save more on ...' mobile-number sheet is not under test here; it is closed only so the floater can be reached
repeat until element prp_rfq_floater is visible (max 10 times)
click if visible b2b_prp_gvs_popup_skip
swipe bottom to top
wait 2 seconds
end repeat
click if visible b2b_prp_gvs_popup_skip
click prp_rfq_floater
wait until url contains "bestdeals_chatbot"
wait until element b2b_assist_login_gate is visible within 20 seconds
verify page contains "Log in to begin!"
verify element b2b_assist_chat_login_link is visible
# no campaign question before login
verify element type_your_message_input is not enabled
take screenshot as login_gate
click b2b_assist_chat_login_link
# the Log In button opens the login sheet (not a dead click)
wait until element rfq_mobile_number_input is visible within 15 seconds
take screenshot as login_sheet_open
take screenshot as nc11_transcript
